From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erik Bourget <erik@ebourget.net>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 01:05:08 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: t8132-j604: Wake from suspend-to-idle on a
 USB-C attach

Mark both USB-C port controllers as wakeup sources. A USB device, dock
or display plugged in while the J713 is in suspend-to-idle wakes it; a
charger does not.

Signed-off-by: Erik Bourget <erik@ebourget.net>
(cherry picked from commit 496efe65f45830099280b9eb1833742b381adc63)
[dylan: J604 form of the J713 change: the same wakeup-source on the
 J604's three SN201202x port controllers (hpm1 and hpm0 on nub SPMI A0,
 hpm3 on A1), which have the J713's "irq", "sleep" and "wake"
 interrupts. The tipd side is f738b993b7 (wake from suspend-to-idle for
 a new USB link), picked with it.]
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts
index 1047b27996..56ed897c4d 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j604.dts
@@ -389,6 +389,7 @@
 			     <43 IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_RISING>,
 			     <45 IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_RISING>; /* DTV-HPM-1b */
 		interrupt-names = "irq", "sleep", "wake";
+		wakeup-source;
 
 		typec1: connector {
 			compatible = "usb-c-connector";
@@ -424,6 +425,7 @@
 			     <17 IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_RISING>,
 			     <19 IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_RISING>; /* DTV-HPM-0b */
 		interrupt-names = "irq", "sleep", "wake";
+		wakeup-source;
 
 		typec0: connector {
 			compatible = "usb-c-connector";
@@ -463,6 +465,7 @@
 			     <17 IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_RISING>,
 			     <19 IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_RISING>;
 		interrupt-names = "irq", "sleep", "wake";
+		wakeup-source;
 
 		typec3: connector {
 			compatible = "usb-c-connector";
